---END---
---START---
select '$."null \u0000 escape"'::jsonpath as not_unescaped;
ERROR:  unsupported Unicode escape sequence
LINE 1: select '$."null \u0000 escape"'::jsonpath as not_unescaped;
               ^
DETAIL:  \u0000 cannot be converted to text.
